ose ob_type is a C type (nil: none)."] [94 1 "// ---- multi-phase initialization (PEP 489; Objects/moduleobject.c's PyModule_FromDefAndSpec2 and PyModule_ExecDef) ----"] [96 1 "// the module slots (Include/moduleobject.h)"] [102 1 "// moduleFromSlots is the module of the PyModuleDef at def whose m_slots is slots: made as PyModule_Create2 makes one"] [103 1 "// (its state of m_size bytes, its functions bound to it; a Py_mod_create slot is not provided), then each Py_mod_exec"] [104 1 "// slot run on it in order, a failing one's exception raised (\"execution of module %s failed without setting an"] [105 1 "// exception\" when it set none, as PyModule_ExecDef)."] [149 1 "// moduleObjSize is sizeof(PyModuleObject) (Objects/moduleobject.h without Py_GIL_DISABLED): PyObject_HEAD, md_dict,"] [150 1 "// md_def, md_state, md_weaklist, md_name."] [153 1 "// writeModuleHead writes a module's PyModuleObject fields into its proxy at a: md_def and md_state (pycore_moduleobject.h's"] [154 1 "// inline _PyModule_GetState reads md_state in place)."] [163 1 "// ---- natives ----"] [165 1 "// interpState is PyInterpreterState_Get's pointer (one interpreter: a block of the world no C reads) and interpDict"] [166 1 "// PyInterpreterState_GetDict's dict."] [172 1 "// tzNames keep the tm_zone strings _PyTime_localtime handed C (a struct tm's char * lives with the program)."] [175 1 "// timeTOverflow is pytime.c's error_time_t_overflow."] [180 1 "// pytimeRound is pytime.c's pytime_round: _PyTime_ROUND_FLOOR 0, CEILING 1, HALF_EVEN 2, UP 3."] [201 1 "// timeTMin is PY_TIME_T_MIN as a double."] [204 1 "// longAsTimeT is _PyLong_AsTime_t (Python/pytime.c): PyLong_AsLongLong, its OverflowError time_t's."] [216 1 "// objectToDenominator is pytime.c's pytime_object_to_denominator: a float split into seconds and a numerator of"] [217 1 "// denominator (pytime_double_to_denominator), an int seconds and 0."] [247 1 "// writeTm fills the struct tm at p (musl's: nine ints, then long tm_gmtoff at 40 and const char *tm_zone at 48) from a"] [248 1 "// time.struct_time."] [275 43 "// Python's Monday 0, C's Sunday 0"] [296 1 "// brokenDown is _PyTime_localtime or _PyTime_gmtime (Python/pytime.c): time.localtime's or time.gmtime's answer (the"] [297 1 "// same localtime_r and gmtime_r, their errors raised as theirs) written into the struct tm at p; 0, else -1 with the error."] [317 1 "// strMethod is the str method name of the one-character string of ch (unicodectype.c's predicates, as str's)."] [339 1 "// divmodNear is _PyLong_DivmodNear (Objects/longobject.c): (q, r) with a = b*q + r and abs(r) <= abs(b)/2, equality"] [340 1 "// only when q is even."] [352 20 "// Euclidean: 0 <= r < |y|"] [354 3 "// floor division's: r of y's sign"] [370 2 "// _Py_NewReference (Objects/object.c; pycore_object.h's inline _PyObject_Init after PyObject_Malloc, datetime's"] [371 2 "// time_alloc and datetime_alloc): the object at op, its ob_type set, a C-born object of its type with one reference"] [390 2 "// _PyStaticType_InitForExtension (Objects/typeobject.c): a static type of an extension readied (PyType_Ready's)"] [400 2 "// _PyType_GetDict (Objects/typeobject.c): the type's dict, borrowed"] [408 2 "// _PyType_Name (Objects/typeobject.c): tp_name past its last dot"] [434 2 "// PyObject_CallMethodObjArgs (Objects/call.c): obj.name(*args), the arguments up to a NULL"] [457 2 "// Py_VaBuildValue (Python/modsupport.c): Py_BuildValue over a va_list (ci's: the address of the next 8-byte slot)"] [470 2 "// PyUnicode_DecodeLocale (Objects/unicodeobject.c): the locale's encoding, UTF-8 (pyi's C.UTF-8), with errors"] [482 2 "// _PyUnicode_Copy (Objects/unicodeobject.c): a new str of the same characters"] [490 2 "// PyUnicode_WriteChar: capi_unicode.go's (queue 594: its checks, the character's range and the type's, are"] [491 2 "// unicode_check_modifiable's and PyUnicode_WriteChar's; _datetime's isoformat writes into a str _PyUnicode_Copy made,"] [492 2 "// which C holds alone)"] [498 2 "/